 "general_notes": [
  "Gross concrete only: no strands, deck slab, end blocks, bearing recesses, sawteeth or lifting details.",
  "Finding: the 2006 Table 5.6.1-1 values omit the 1 in bottom chamfers. With chamfers removed, the 2006 table is reproduced exactly for W50G, WF42G, WF50G and WF58G. The 2025 table includes the chamfers and matches the drawn outlines exactly. Therefore 2025 values are the validation target where they exist.",
  "2006 WF74G/W83G/W95G table rows differ from both conventions by <0.3% (older depth values 82.62/94.49 in); not used for validation."
 ],
