  "SLAB": {
   "geometry_notes": [
    "2025 properties equal a (module - 1 in) rectangle minus circular voids centred at mid-depth, with keys ignored: 12\": 47x12 = 564, I = 6768 exactly; 18\": 846 - 3*63.62 = 655.1, I 21876; 26\": 1222 - 2*193.59 = 834.8, I 62875; 24\": 740.8, I 48178; 30\"x4'-4\": 51x30 - 2*254.47 = 1021.1, I 104444. The implementation uses that convention (joint shear keys omitted: 5.6-A1-8 shows a V key with 1\" top and 3/16\" bottom joint offsets only).",
    "2006 void layouts: 18\": 9\" voids at 0 and +/-12 1/2\" (1'-0 1/2\"), 11 1/2\" from joint; 26\": 15.7\" voids at +/-9\", 1'-3\" from joint.",
    "24\" (2 x 15.7\") and 30\" x 4'-4\" (2 x 18\") are not in 2006; H, W, count and diameter from the 2026 PRELIMINARY table. Horizontal void positions are estimates: 24\" uses the 26\" layout (+/-9\"); 30\" uses +/-10\" (2\" between voids, 6.5\" edge walls). These affect Iy only, not A/Yb/Ix."
   ],
